// GPU class: high
//
// States a texture edge of 2048 voxels and 32 GB of texture memory. 2048 is the
// hard limit that every known WebGL device holds, and 32 GB is the largest
// memory of the shipped profiles.
//
// `high` is the default of Cornerstone3D, and not of OHIF: OHIF uses
// `gpu/medium`. Load this profile only on a device that holds that much
// texture memory. A device of the middle class can crash under it.
//
// The profile is a stated value and not a measurement. Nothing probes the
// device, so a real device may hold less than this profile states.
//
// Load it with `?customization=gpu/high`.
{
  "bootstrap": {
    "cornerstone.gpuCapabilityProfile": "high"
  }
}
